  "2026-08-30T15:36:11.581Z",pi-agent,"Rebased onto origin/main. Resolved .gitignore by retaining main current transaction-journal policy; resolved .github/workflows/ci.yml by retaining both release verifiers; resolved package.json by retaining main current version/dependency/release-workflow gates plus the changelog-date verifier; resolved CHANGELOG.md by taking the requested rebase side and regenerating after close. Upgraded pm-changelog to 2026.8.29 and made the executable probe use 2026.1.2-2. npm run verify:release-changelog-date, npm test, and npm run release:check pass with 100% configured coverage. Regression proofs: removing --date-from-version made the verifier fail; installing pm-changelog 2026.8.17 while retaining the suffix probe also made it fail; both restored versions pass."
